  "solution": {
    "text": "The binding energy per nucleon is practically independent of the atomic number for nuclei of mass number in range $30 \\lt \\mathrm{A} \\lt 17^{\\circ}$.\nSo, $26^{\\mathrm{Fe}^{56}}$ has maximum binding energy per nucleon.",
